        <!--
            The app writes every view model value before the first frame, so these entry choices see them.
            Main: Settled under Reduce Motion (`still`), else Play.
            Streak: Static when `still` or not `newDay`, else Streak Beat.
            Ambient: drifts unless `still`.
        -->
